<title>TUNISIA: Tunis bourse slightly up in higher trade.</title>
<headline>Tunis bourse slightly up in higher trade.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunis Stock Exchange index closed 0.26 percent higher on Wednesday in more active trading, bourse sources said.</p>
<p>The market's 30-share index closed at 605.43 from 603.84 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Trade volume was 2.144 million dinars against 633,646 dinars.</p>
<p>($= 0.98 dinar)</p>
